Footage Cam
===========

The camera behaviour in this mod (turn/strafe tilt, handheld sway, delayed camera follow and the
reprojection based motion blur) is modelled on the camera system of "SP-Backrooms Revamped"
by SpacePotato and Herr Chaos (https://www.youtube.com/@SpacePotatoee), which is published under
the GNU General Public License / LGPL-3.0 (the jar ships GPL-3.0 text and declares LGPL-3.0-only).

This is a rewrite for Forge 1.20.1 (the original is a Fabric mod built on Veil). No assets,
textures or shaders were copied; the algorithms and tuning values were carried over.

Because of that origin this project is released under the GNU General Public License v3.0
(see LICENSE). If you share the mod, keep this notice, keep the license, and make the source
available.
